{
  "format": "owa-conformance-v1",
  "specVersion": "owa.dev/v1",
  "operation": "pack",
  "notes": [
    "Materialize input.files beneath a fresh directory, then input.symlinks; call packDirectory with input.entrypoint. Always remove temporary directories.",
    "contentBase64 encodes exact bytes. Symlink target is relative to the link; targetType directory is only a filesystem setup hint. Symlinks must be rejected even if safe-looking or dangling.",
    "Ordering guarantees in these pack vectors intentionally cover only lowercase ASCII names: the reference uses localeCompare and does not yet define portable Unicode pack ordering.",
    "expected.manifest, canonicalJson, artifactDigest, blobDigests are static independent goldens; every returned blob must also equal the source bytes."
  ],
